---
description: Merging collapsible if statements increases the code’s readability.
globs:
  - '**/*.cs'
alwaysApply: true
---
# Rule content

Noncompliant code example <pre>
if (condition1)
{
if (condition2)
{
// ...
}
}
</pre>
 Compliant solution <pre>
if (condition1 && condition2)
{
// ...
}
</pre>
